  "sids/Daglish_Ben/Chicken_Song_s.sid": "(#1)\n  TITLE: The Chicken Song [from Spit in Your Ear]\n ARTIST: Rob Grant & Doug Naylor (lyrics), Philip Pope (music).\nCOMMENT: Deliberately out of tune.\n         See /MUSICIANS/H/Hubbard_Rob/Chicken_Song.sid for further info.\n(#2)\n  TITLE: The Chicken Song [from Spit in Your Ear]\n ARTIST: Rob Grant & Doug Naylor (lyrics), Philip Pope (music).\nCOMMENT: Deliberately out of tune.\n         See /MUSICIANS/H/Hubbard_Rob/Chicken_Song.sid for further info.",
