  "sids/Tel_Jeroen/S-Express.sid": "  TITLE: Theme From S-Express [from Original Soundtrack]\n ARTIST: S'Express, written by Mark Moore and Pascal Gabriel\nCOMMENT: \"It was a cover of just the bassline... It's not like the original\n         really, but you can hear a big resemblance. :)\" (JT)",
