  "sids/Tel_Jeroen/Viz.sid": "(#1)\nCOMMENT: The music is a medley of famous tunes and jingles. (It's a real mess\n         to try to make a proper entry with times...the music sometimes repeats\n         the same covers later, etc.)\n(#8)\n  TITLE: Barbara Ann\n ARTIST: The Beach Boys",
