  "sids/Whittaker_David/Chicken_Farm.sid": "  TITLE: The Chicken Song [from Spit in Your Ear]\n ARTIST: Rob Grant & Doug Naylor (lyrics), Philip Pope (music).\nCOMMENT: See /MUSICIANS/H/Hubbard_Rob/Chicken_Song.sid for further info.",
  "sids/Whittaker_David/Cosmonut.sid": "COMMENT: Also used in the game \"Shadow\" (C) 1987 Mastertronic.",
