  "sids/Whittaker_David/David_Music_Demo_2.sid": "COMMENT: An early version of /MUSICIANS/W/Whittaker_David/Max_Headroom.sid,\n         Tune #1, with minimal memory used.",
  "sids/Whittaker_David/David_Music_Demo_3.sid": "  TITLE: Max Headroom (End Titles) [from the TV series]\n ARTIST: Midge Ure & Chris Cross\nCOMMENT: Similar to /MUSICIANS/W/Whittaker_David/Max_Headroom_preview_v2.sid, Tune #3",
  "sids/Whittaker_David/Dizzy.sid": "(#1)\n  TITLE: Title Theme [from the ZX Spectrum game Dizzy]\n ARTIST: Jon Paul Eldridge",
  "sids/Whittaker_David/Dynamic_Duo.sid": "COMMENT: Tunes #2 and #3 sound bugged, however they are called in the game and\n         this is how they sound.",
  "sids/Whittaker_David/Elektra_Glide.sid": "  TITLE: Elektra Glide\n ARTIST: Yekao\nCOMMENT: \"The music to Elektra Glide was advertised as being composed by a\n         professional musician, but that musician wasn't Whittaker: it was a\n         session musician for the Gil Scott-Heron band who went under the\n         pseudonym Yekao. Whittaker just covered the Atari version for the\n         C64 version\" (Info from Chris Abbott)",
